      "alias": "mass-times",
      "categoryId": "118",
      "categoryTitle": "- Homepage Articles - Edit Only",
      "introtext": "\t<div class=\"mass-times-box\">\n<div class=\"mass-times-content\">\n<h1>Weekend Masses</h1>\n<p><strong>Saturday</strong>: 5:00pm<br /><strong>Sunday</strong>: 8:00am, 10:00am, 12:00pm<br /><strong>Mass in Spanish</strong> is celebrated on the second and fourth Saturdays of the month at 7:30pm<br /><strong>Mass in Urdu (Pakistan)</strong> is celebrated on the second Sunday of each month at 2:00pm</p>\n<h1>Daily Masses</h1>\n<p><strong>Monday - Saturday</strong>: 8:00am</p>\n<h1>Confessions</h1>\n<p><strong>Saturday</strong>: 3:00-4:00pm in Church Prayer Room</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mass-times-buttons\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"livestream\">Watch Mass Live</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"holy-days-special-masses\">Holy Days &amp; Special Masses </a></div>\n</div>",
